 "structural_change": "S81-HEAD HD-TILE 10-21 MAIN: new tile ot_s81hd_tile (SPEC v1 4e30e8f3a section 1: LM-head array tile, 253 a die) = census-safe bundle copy ot_s81hd_bundle (5 elements, 10 ROM4096, 128 rows; IOREG 1, SAFE 1) on bus B (565 b) with the chain-best merge.  Outline 648.0 x 648.0: each element's ROM pair is one abutted N-S stack (ROM pins sit on the W / E faces, lowest 14 um, M4; stack pin ends face the band): N stacks A0 / B / A1 at x 86.4 / 259.2 / 432 (y 477.36), S stacks A2 / A3 at x 172.8 / 345.6 (y 43.2); one full-width std-cell band y 169.1..477.36 plus the column channels; i on W, o on E, straps / ck / rst_n on W.",
